# Pinned llm-d revision that deploy/llm-d/a30 is known to apply cleanly against.
#
# install.sh fetches and checks this out, so upstream changes to llm-d's base
# manifests can only reach us through an explicit, reviewable bump of this file
# -- not silently on the next deploy. When bumping, re-run install.sh: the
# `kubectl kustomize` step is where a base restructuring will surface.
#
# First non-comment line is used. Override ad hoc with LLMD_REF=<ref>.
